---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.astro';
import { membership } from '../data/membership.mjs';
import '../styles/membership.css';
---
<Platform title="Membership" description="One Digivated membership. $5 USD once for one project spotlight and full News access when it launches. No recurring charges.">
<section class="membership-page" aria-labelledby="membership-title">
  <header class="membership-heading"><p class="eyebrow">DIGIVATED MEMBERSHIP</p><h1 id="membership-title">One membership.<br/><em>More room to stand out.</em></h1><p>Put your project in the spotlight. Get the full story when News arrives.</p></header>
  <article class="membership-offer" aria-label="Digivated Membership offer">
    <div class="membership-offer-heading"><span class="membership-plan-label">The complete membership</span><span class="membership-once">One-time purchase</span></div>
    <div class="membership-price"><strong>${membership.priceUSD}</strong><span>USD once<br/><small>No recurring charges</small></span></div>
    <div class="membership-benefits"><div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="sparkle" size={22}/></span><div><h2>One project in the spotlight</h2><p>One featured project placement for your membership. Submit a working project for review before it goes live.</p></div></div><div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full News access <span class="membership-soon">Coming soon</span></h2><p>Full access to the members-only News section when it launches. News is being built and is not available yet.</p></div></div></div>
    {membership.checkoutReady ? <a class="button primary membership-checkout" href={membership.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get membership · $5 once <UiIcon name="external" size={17}/></a> : <><button class="button primary membership-checkout" disabled>Checkout being updated</button><p class="membership-checkout-note" role="status">The new offer is being set up on Gumroad. Purchases will open once the listing is ready.</p></>}
    <p class="membership-small">Checkout, receipts, and applicable taxes are handled by Gumroad. There is no monthly or yearly renewal.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="membership-next"><p>Browsing and submitting for ordinary directory review remain free.</p><a href="/submit-project">Share a project <UiIcon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div>
  <section id="member-sign-in" class="membership-access" aria-labelledby="membership-access-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">ALREADY A MEMBER?</p><h2 id="membership-access-title">Your membership, right here.</h2><p>Use the license key or purchase email from your membership receipt. Your existing Founding Membership continues to work.</p><p id="membership-verified" hidden>Your membership is verified. <a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit your included spotlight request</a>.</p></div><div><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button" type="submit">Verify membership</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of membership</button></div></section>
  <section class="membership-faq" aria-labelledby="membership-questions"><h2 id="membership-questions">A few useful details.</h2><details><summary>Is this a subscription?</summary><p>No. Membership costs $5 USD once. There are no recurring charges or automatic renewals.</p></details><details><summary>How does the project spotlight work?</summary><p>Your membership includes one project spotlight. Sign in, then choose the membership option when submitting your project. Digivated reviews its image, description, and destination before featuring it. Projects must meet the site’s listing rules; payment does not bypass review or guarantee traffic, sales, or engagement.</p></details><details><summary>Can I read News today?</summary><p>Not yet. The News section is being built. Your membership will include full News access when it launches; no launch date is being promised.</p></details><details id="previous-purchases"><summary>What about a previous purchase?</summary><p>Existing purchases keep their original access. <a href="/access">Open your Prompt Packet</a>, <a href="/carousels">browse your carousels</a>, or use the membership form above. If you previously purchased a standalone promotion, <a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">submit that existing purchase for review</a>. Those products are no longer advertised for separate purchase on Digivated.</p><ul id="founding-inventory-list" hidden></ul></details></section>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/carousel-library.js'; import '../scripts/membership-checkout.js';</script>
</Platform>
